iginal/oZuKOoiqUsZZcgO5wqlUoZQUPfw.jpg"},{"id":227879,"name":"Kana Asumi","role":"Nyaruko (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5GroiCPTO6PcYaZQXTGWltoT1kq.jpg"},{"id":221772,"name":"Wataru Hatano","role":"Yoichi Takehiko","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i1meHlOXLP2ubJZkmyGJONrxikQ.jpg"},{"id":219563,"name":"Satomi Arai","role":"Shantak-kun","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v95wU1gpSLAOJS5yKFTxyheXAW2.jpg"},{"id":114906,"name":"Ryoka Yuzuki","role":"Kuune","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kRiagleTO13MWYXl77xGDBDerxM.jpg"},{"id":124478,"name":"Aya Hisakawa","role":"Yasaka Yoriko","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5asVy8H7VSDQKVdURubT0QHjsld.jpg"},{"id":1253731,"name":"Shiori Mikami","role":"Ghutatan","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vA4xHsvHIC1Kpll63hMsUANjDA3.jpg"},{"id":1820105,"name":"Yuka Otsubo","role":"Kurei Tamao","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sagY1IOfM6SISIYNrQCXdXBIyb4.jpg"},{"id":554513,"name":"Mariko Kouda","role":"Ruuhii Jistone","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gmhgVyiHoN4B2JBD5X8uPwG8vir.jpg"},{"id":83928,"name":"Rie Kugimiya","role":"Hasuta","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xHonhNFpTpz9zCVXLAF7D4OuHLv.jpg"},{"id":1222195,"name":"Miyu Matsuki","role":"Kuuko","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yZvIbrzXDCrBlFMqfmdJI3AptY4.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Nyarko-san: Another Crawling Chaos","overview":"Protagonista della storia è Nyaruko-san (Nyarlathotep), una divinità del caos in grado di assumere qualsiasi forma desideri. A dispetto del nome, Nyaruko non appare molto temibile, infatti, tra le molte forme a sua disposizione, la divinità preferisce apparire con le sembianze di una normale e graziosa ragazza dai capelli d'argento. Proprio in questa veste Nyaruko incontrerà Mahiro Yasaka, uno studente perseguitato dagli alieni, aiutandolo nella sua disperata fuga."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Nyarko-san: Another Crawling Chaos","overview":"Mahiro Yasaka is just an ordinary high school student, until one day he is suddenly attacked by a dangerous monster. Just when everything seems to be lost, he is saved by a strange girl named Nyaruko, who claims to be the shape-shifting deity Nyarlathotep from horror author H. P. Lovecraft's Cthulhu Mythos."},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"這いよれ！ニャル子さん","overview":"銀髪の美少女が、とてつもなく意味不明なキャッチフレーズとともに現れた！\n\nクトゥルー神話の邪神「這いよる混沌」ニャルラトホテプ、長いので略してニャル子。「生ける炎」クトゥグアのクー子や、「名状しがたきもの」ハスターのハス太も加えて、底知れぬ暗澹たる恐怖とラブ（クラフト）コメディがここに開幕！\n\n八坂真尋やニャル子を狙って、次々と地球にやって来る邪神たち。それを迎え撃つニャル子の宇宙CQC。宇宙規模で繰り広げられる壮絶な事件の真相とは？はたして、真尋は平和に暮らすことができるのか！？\n\n怒涛のハイテンション混沌コメディ、ついにTVアニメに這いよります！","tagline":"いつもニコニコあなたの隣に這いよる混沌、ニャルラトホテプです♪"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4evG2D13QCUCuVnH4Gfy6a1cM74.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4evG2D13QCUCuVnH4Gfy6a1cM74.png","language":"xx","width":784,"height":202},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lJVoDMxSiR3WLrirSYlKKQyAmbf.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lJVoDMxSiR3WLrirSYlKKQyAmbf.png","language":"ja","width":1171,"height":679}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/37tfOPuIout9BJbyuJfGIjy6n0n.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/37tfOPuIout9BJbyuJfGIjy6n0n.jpg","language":"en","width":1828,"height":2742},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r7oHbNaACrhNOu50Byezc8PjvQL.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r7oHbNaACrhNOu50Byezc8PjvQL.jpg","language":"ja","width":1536,"height":2184},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/VUs3KVUyCj0kaKKv0Ul63VHzFT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/VUs3KVUyCj0kaKKv0Ul63VHzFT.jpg","language":"ja","width":542,"height":813},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/znQvrltrSDvWQKq65Sgyq9QeAqs.jpg","p